{"source": "app_details", "url": "https://store.steampowered.com/api/appdetails?appids=5052450&cc=us&l=english", "collected_at": "2026-11-10T08:51:05Z", "http_status": 200, "payload": {"5052450": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Desktop Wallet Heroes", "steam_appid": 5052450, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "dlc": [5240900, 5251650, 5251740, 5245760, 5240950, 5240970, 5317060], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your desktop is now an epic battlefield!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Desktop Wallet Heroes is a desktop overlay RPG where non-stop battles unfold in the narrow space at the bottom of your screen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While you focus on your other tasks, your characters are busy fighting off endless hordes of monsters right below your active windows.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Just leave the game running, and they'll fight and level up all on their own!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Merge &amp; Throw: The Endless Evolution of Stones</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combine identical stones to evolve them into increasingly powerful weapons, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >from ordinary pebbles to legendary stones. Merge various gear and items to build your very own ultimate desktop Expedition.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5052450/extras/990250f4489b91a170c7f37228d82de5.poster.avif?t=1794274166\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5052450/extras/990250f4489b91a170c7f37228d82de5.webm?t=1794274166\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5052450/extras/990250f4489b91a170c7f37228d82de5.mp4?t=1794274166\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Non-Stop Looting &amp; Thrilling Rewards</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeat monsters to rake in mountains of gold and collect rare loot. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spend your hard-earned resources to upgrade your skills and level up your characters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5052450/extras/f3397b820f8417f01217b4e3124074f2.poster.avif?t=1794274166\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5052450/extras/f3397b820f8417f01217b4e3124074f2.webm?t=1794274166\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5052450/extras/f3397b820f8417f01217b4e3124074f2.mp4?t=1794274166\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Ultimate Multitasking Experience (Zero Distractions!)</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy a seamless overlay that never gets in the way of your other windows. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Leave the game running idly in the background when you're busy, and jump in to click and upgrade when you have a free moment. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It is highly optimized with minimal resource consumption, ensuring your PC runs smoothly no matter what else you're doing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5052450/extras/42a34a851305f2154c811e25bd826e0a.poster.avif?t=1794274166\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5052450/extras/42a34a851305f2154c811e25bd826e0a.webm?t=1794274166\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5052450/extras/42a34a851305f2154c811e25bd826e0a.mp4?t=1794274166\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your desktop is now an epic battlefield!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Desktop Wallet Heroes is a desktop overlay RPG where non-stop battles unfold in the narrow space at the bottom of your screen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While you focus on your other tasks, your characters are busy fighting off endless hordes of monsters right below your active windows.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Just leave the game running, and they'll fight and level up all on their own!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Merge &amp; Throw: The Endless Evolution of Stones</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combine identical stones to evolve them into increasingly powerful weapons, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >from ordinary pebbles to legendary stones. Merge various gear and items to build your very own ultimate desktop Expedition.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5052450/extras/990250f4489b91a170c7f37228d82de5.poster.avif?t=1794274166\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5052450/extras/990250f4489b91a170c7f37228d82de5.webm?t=1794274166\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5052450/extras/990250f4489b91a170c7f37228d82de5.mp4?t=1794274166\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Non-Stop Looting &amp; Thrilling Rewards</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeat monsters to rake in mountains of gold and collect rare loot. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spend your hard-earned resources to upgrade your skills and level up your characters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5052450/extras/f3397b820f8417f01217b4e3124074f2.poster.avif?t=1794274166\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5052450/extras/f3397b820f8417f01217b4e3124074f2.webm?t=1794274166\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5052450/extras/f3397b820f8417f01217b4e3124074f2.mp4?t=1794274166\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Ultimate Multitasking Experience (Zero Distractions!)</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy a seamless overlay that never gets in the way of your other windows. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Leave the game running idly in the background when you're busy, and jump in to click and upgrade when you have a free moment. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It is highly optimized with minimal resource consumption, ensuring your PC runs smoothly no matter what else you're doing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5052450/extras/42a34a851305f2154c811e25bd826e0a.poster.avif?t=1794274166\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5052450/extras/42a34a851305f2154c811e25bd826e0a.webm?t=1794274166\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5052450/